'What does the passage suggest is the main value of democracy, despite its flaws?','{"A":"It ensures all citizens are well-informed","B":"It produces the best-qualified leaders","C":"It is the most effective safeguard against abuse of power","D":"It encourages genuine political engagement"}','{"value":"C"}','The final sentence states democracy remains the most effective safeguard against abuse of power.','PUBLISHED',NOW(),NULL),
